&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Editions, our network of delivery-only kitchens, is a key differentiator in France commercial ambition. &lt;/strong&gt;The Account Management Lead – Editions France role is created as part of a wider reorganisation of the Editions business as part of our regional strategy. The role reports to Paris regional leadership and is designed to combine strategic partner leadership, P&amp;amp;L ownership and organisation building across the Editions network.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As &lt;strong&gt;Account Management Lead – Editions France&lt;/strong&gt;, you will lead the Editions commercial team for France constituted of Senior Account Managers, Account Managers and Sales Managers. You will be the guardian of the Editions strategy for France, accountable for its coordination and its execution on the ground, growing the performance and profitability of our sites while driving occupancy and the differentiation Editions brings to the French market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own a portion of the Editions P&amp;amp;L. That means holding the commercial scorecard for new kitchens, making financial decisions with a clear view of both partner and Deliveroo profitability, and steering your team&#39;s portfolio towards sustainable growth rather than volume alone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be accountable for the development plan for your team, their success and learning curve at Deliveroo; setting the right KPIs and OKRs to monitor the business. Your role will be commercially focused, however Editions is as much a project management discipline as a commercial one: you will work hand in hand with Food Safety, Compliance, Site Construction, Kitchen Layout, Site Operations, Marketing and the International Editions team to bring kitchens live and keep them performing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Editions Strategy &amp;amp; Growth&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as the guardian of the Editions strategy for France, ensuring its coordination across teams and its disciplined execution site by site&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead your team&#39;s portfolio strategy, growing the performance and profitability of each Editions site in line with agreed targets&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop the business so that it fits within, and contributes to, the wider regional strategy, bringing the specificity of the French network to regional and international forums&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and deliver joint business plans with restaurant partners, identifying growth and profitability opportunities, defining mutual goals and finding compelling ways to solve them (menu optimisation, virtual brands, pricing, packaging, catchment expansion)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinate with the Media team to identify and negotiate revenue opportunities to generate additional value from Editions sites&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Occupancy &amp;amp; Commercial Performance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the occupancy trajectory of the French network, partnering closely with Local teams to positively drive occupancy and secure signed contracts within agreed timelines&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own and enforce the Editions commercial scorecard for new kitchens, profitability checks against P&amp;amp;L guidelines, launch package, site specificities, ensuring the process is applied consistently across the team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Steer the lead generation and pipeline process, mapping high-potential restaurants and cuisine gaps by site, and mobilising other commercial stakeholders to qualify interest&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead commercial negotiations with business owners and C-suite operators, supporting proposals with a robust P&amp;amp;L rationale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;P&amp;amp;L Ownership &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own a portion of the Editions P&amp;amp;L, accountable for revenue, profitability and the financial health of your perimeter&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Set, own and deliver performance targets across occupancy, partner health, site profitability and Deliveroo output metrics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Run a clear operating rhythm on reporting, velocity, sign-to-live, occupancy and sales reviews, and use it to make decisions, not just to describe results&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kitchen Launches &amp;amp; Cross-functional Execution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work with Site Managers, Food Safety, Compliance, Site Construction and Kitchen Layout teams to secure the successful build and launch of new kitchens&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinate with Global team on kitchen implementation, and with Marketing and Operations on launch packages, so that every opening lands on time and performs from week one&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage and oversee project execution end to end, including B2B communication and cross-business-unit workshops&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Propose process optimisation and automation: Deliveroo moves fast, and you will improve the processes that let Editions scale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Senior Stakeholder Management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as the senior point of contact and face of Deliveroo Editions for top restaurant partners, building trusted, long-term relationships and representing Deliveroo at partner events&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Establish a strong operating rhythm with partners, including quarterly business reviews and monthly performance check-ins&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Serve as a trusted advisor to senior stakeholders, providing strategic insights on Deliveroo, competitors and broader industry trends&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Team Leadership: Support and coach your Account Managers and Sales Managers to build and execute strong commercial and operational plans, and to raise the standard of account management across the Editions network&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;min-height: 1.2em; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;7+ years working in commercially focused roles&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience managing medium-sized commercial or account management teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Highly analytical, with proven P&amp;amp;L ownership or strong financial decision-making experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Solid project management skills, with a track record of delivering complex, cross-functional projects on time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mix of both strategy and execution experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comfortable handling negotiations with business owners or C-suite operators&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Effective collaborator, able to influence internal stakeholders across functions and geographies, including global teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Relationship-building and communication skills whether face-to-face, through phone or email&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Adaptable and comfortable working in a rapidly changing environment; proactive and creative problem solver&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Entrepreneurial mindset with a passion for food and operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be in the field often, which will require travel (depending on the needs)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Previous general management experience, or experience running your own business would be desirable&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fluent in French and English is required&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;min-height: 1.2em; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation, and growth drives everything we do. Our Commercial team sits at the centre of Deliveroo’s marketplace—shaping how we serve restaurants, grocers, and new verticals worldwide. From negotiating key partnerships to unlocking new revenue streams and crafting data-led growth strategies, we take on big challenges that move the business forward. If you thrive in fast-paced, commercial environments and want to influence the future of a global brand—this is the team for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an &lt;strong&gt;SMB Account Manager (French Market)&lt;/strong&gt; to join our &lt;strong&gt;Manchester&lt;/strong&gt; team. In this role, you’ll help us empower restaurant partners across France to get the very best out of our platform by advising on marketing, technology, and operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role offers a £35,300 OTE yearly package (basic salary £29,300 + up to £6000 bonus yearly).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is hybrid (3 days a week in office / 2 days remote working).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start Date - November 2026&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be joining the &lt;strong&gt;SMB (Small Medium Business)&lt;/strong&gt; team. Based in Manchester City Centre, we are a high-energy group that supports local independent restaurants through a desk-based consultancy model, helping them navigate the rapidly expanding delivery industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Portfolio Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead a diverse portfolio of accounts using a desk-based model, supporting growth through phone, email, and digital presentations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relationship Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain long-term relationships with our French partner base, ensuring high-quality service and driving positive outcomes for both the restaurant and Deliveroo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Campaign Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive engagement with national and local marketing opportunities to improve key performance metrics, including order volume and partner retention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Liaison:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the bridge between your restaurants and internal teams to ensure our solutions are delivered according to partner needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Use insights to identify performance barriers and implement creative solutions that help partners offer the best delivery experience possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional fluency in French&lt;/strong&gt;, with the ability to converse confidently with business owners in the French market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven track record in account management&lt;/strong&gt;, with strong relationship-building skills that consistently produce positive results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong communication skills&lt;/strong&gt;, specifically an excellent phone manner and experience providing high-quality support via telephone or video.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical ability&lt;/strong&gt;, with a knack for understanding complex problems and finding the crux of an issue quickly using data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative problem-solving&lt;/strong&gt;, with an enthusiastic approach to removing barriers and a keen interest in how technology drives partner success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interview Process &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step 1: Apply&lt;/strong&gt; – Apply for any role you’d like to be considered for. We’re looking forward to hearing from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step 2: AI Screening &amp;amp; Assessment&lt;/strong&gt; – If your application is successful, you’ll be invited to complete a short phone screening and online assessment with our AI assistant, &lt;strong&gt;Maki People&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;em&gt;Things to note: this step must be completed to progress &amp;amp; If you can&#39;t find the link to the assessment in your inbox, please check your junk/spam!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step 3: Recruiter Screen&lt;/strong&gt; – You’ll have a 15-30 minute conversation with someone from Deliveroo to talk through your experience in more detail, learn more about the role, and get guidance on how to prepare for the next stages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step 4: Interview &amp;amp; Case Study&lt;/strong&gt; – You’ll be invited to interview with one of our Managers, which may include a case study where you’ll present your findings (online or onsite).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step 5: Outcome&lt;/strong&gt; – We’ll get back to you after your interview to let you know the result!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Make a visible impact every day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your work directly improves experiences for customers, partners and riders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;Learn fast in an entrepreneurial environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work close to the market with autonomy, pace and real responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Build a career, not just a role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stretch yourself, develop new skills and grow as the business evolves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;Deliver together in an inclusive culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborative, values-driven teams that support how you work best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about how we hire &lt;a class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/how-we-hire/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi Deliveroo ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous transformons la façon dont le monde mange et fait ses courses en rendant leur accès plus pratique et agréable. Nous connectons les consommateurs, les restaurants, les magasins et les cyclistes. Nous donnons à chaque personne la possibilité d&#39;acheter ce qu&#39;elles veulent, comme elles le veulent, quand elles le veulent et où elles le veulent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous sommes une entreprise axée sur la technologie, à l&#39;avant-garde d’un secteur qui connaît une des expansions les plus rapides au monde. Nous avançons rapidement, valorisons l&#39;autonomie, et sommes toujours en recherche de nouvelles idées et de personnes talentueuses pour nous rejoindre!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;En tant qu&#39;Account Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;vous serez responsable du succès de votre portefeuille de comptes&lt;/strong&gt;, afin d’assurer une expérience magique à nos utilisateurs, tout en construisant un socle solide et durable pour notre application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;min-height: 1.2em; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MISSIONS :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Votre objectif sera de créer un partenariat privilégié, durable en apportant votre expertise marketplace, foodtech et account management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous aurez comme missions principales la gestion et l’optimisation de la croissance et la profitabilité d’un portefeuille de partenaires et le respect des objectifs fixés (opérationnels et commerciaux, ventes de services)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous développerez des joint business plans avec les principaux acteurs de votre portefeuille en vous appuyant sur des routines (price, range, roll out, ops, tech review) pour faire croître le partenariat des comptes de votre équipe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous serez en charge du déploiement et de l’expansion de votre portefeuille ainsi que des différentes campagnes Marketing que vous devrez négocier dans le cadre du “joint business plan”.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Analyse quotidienne de la data de la performance des marques et de nos opérations Deliveroo pour identifier les causes des problèmes et améliorer constamment le niveau de service.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Optimisation et gestion de processus : Deliveroo est une société qui évolue à grande vitesse et à grande échelle. Vous aurez l’opportunité de créer et améliorer des processus, par exemple la gestion de partenariats pour contribuer à la croissance. Vous élaborerez des outils et des guides de meilleures pratiques pour des comptes spécifiques et pour l&#39;ensemble du portefeuille.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous veillerez au suivi du respect des engagements contractuels pris avec les partenaires de votre portefeuille.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;min-height: 1.2em; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PROFIL : &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3 à 6 ans d&#39;expérience d’account management ou de commercial. Une expérience chez une grande enseigne de la grande distribution serait un vrai plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial:&lt;/strong&gt; vous savez négocier, anticiper des discussions commerciales, entreprendre des actions afin de maintenir un portefeuille de qualité (discussions contractuelles, négociations de mise en place d&#39;outils commerciaux, etc)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stratégique: &lt;/strong&gt;vous savez prendre du recul, comprendre des problématiques non structurées et proposer des solutions via des plans d’actions et un suivi de résultats&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytique:&lt;/strong&gt; capable d’être synthétique, d&#39;approfondir les données et de comprendre les données qui permettent d&#39;améliorer les performances pour nos partenaires en magasins&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactif(-ive): &lt;/strong&gt;vous adorez être sur le terrain et vous êtes impliqué(e) dans tout ce qui est opérationnel dans votre périmètre.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Centré(e) sur le client:&lt;/strong&gt; être obsédé par nos clients. Utiliser des données quantitatives et qualitatives pour construire un service qui soit opérationnellement excellent pour nos clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Français et Anglais courant indispensables&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;min-height: 1.2em; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;À compétences égales, ce poste est ouvert aux travailleurs et travailleuses en situation de handicap ou assimilés au sens de l’article L5212-13 du Code du travail. Deliveroo s’engage en faveur de la diversité, l’égalité professionnelle, l’emploi des personnes en situation de handicap. Deliveroo France valorise la diversité sans discrimination de genre, race, sexualité, religion ou préférences personnelles. Avec un score de 98/100 à l&#39;Indice de l&#39;Égalité Hommes-Femmes 2024, nous sommes engagés envers l&#39;égalité des chances. Rejoignez-nous avec votre passion pour la nourriture dans une entreprise en pleine croissance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;min-height: 1.2em; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
