&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;Rejoignez-nous dans notre mission de transformer la façon dont le monde mange et fait ses courses. Chez Deliveroo, impact, innovation et croissance sont au cœur de tout ce que nous faisons. Notre équipe Commerciale développe des partenariats durables avec des restaurants et commerçants partout en France afin de les accompagner dans leur croissance grâce à des solutions innovantes, une approche orientée data et une excellence opérationnelle au quotidien.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous recherchons un(e) &lt;strong&gt;Account Manager&lt;/strong&gt; pour rejoindre notre équipe en France, dans un environnement de travail hybride avec des déplacements réguliers sur votre secteur. Dans ce rôle, vous contribuerez activement au développement et au succès d’un portefeuille stratégique de partenaires restaurants, tout en garantissant la meilleure expérience possible à nos partenaires comme à nos clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✨ Découvrez notre équipe Commerciale - ce qui nous anime, notre façon de travailler et ce que vous pouvez attendre de nous.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce que vous ferez au quotidien&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein de notre équipe Commerciale Régionale, vous accompagnerez vos partenaires restaurants dans le développement de leur activité sur Deliveroo. Votre rôle sera à la fois stratégique, analytique et relationnel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vos principales missions :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gérer et développer un portefeuille stratégique de restaurants partenaires sur des marchés matures&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Construire des relations solides et durables avec vos partenaires en devenant leur interlocuteur(trice) privilégié(e) et expert(e) Food Tech sur votre secteur&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Analyser les performances commerciales et opérationnelles afin d’identifier des leviers de croissance et des opportunités d’optimisation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recommander et déployer des campagnes marketing et promotionnelles adaptées aux besoins de votre portefeuille&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborer étroitement avec les Regional et City Managers afin de partager des recommandations stratégiques et des insights marché&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Accompagner les partenaires dans l’amélioration de leurs opérations et de l’expérience client&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Réaliser une veille concurrentielle régulière afin d’anticiper les tendances et identifier de nouvelles opportunités de développement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce qu’il vous faut pour réussir&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre candidat(e) idéal(e) possède une expérience solide dans plusieurs des domaines suivants, ainsi qu’une forte envie d’apprendre et d’évoluer dans un environnement dynamique :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Expérience en gestion de comptes stratégiques ou en développement de partenariats commerciaux&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellentes compétences relationnelles et capacité à construire des partenariats de confiance sur le long terme&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Solides compétences en négociation et en gestion commerciale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capacité à analyser des données de performance et à transformer les insights en actions concrètes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Autonomie, sens des priorités et capacité à gérer plusieurs sujets simultanément&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Esprit proactif, orienté résultats et amélioration continue&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Très bonnes compétences en communication en français et en anglais, à l’écrit comme à l’oral&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation, and growth drives everything we do. Our Commercial team sits at the centre of Deliveroo’s marketplace—shaping how we serve restaurants, grocers, and new verticals worldwide. From negotiating key partnerships to unlocking new revenue streams and crafting data-led growth strategies, we take on big challenges that move the business forward. If you thrive in fast-paced, commercial environments and want to influence the future of a global brand—this is the team for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be joining the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Grocery &amp;amp; Retail&lt;/strong&gt; team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This position is based in Genova.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Relationship Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee a portfolio of restaurant brands, building lasting partnerships and acting as a primary point of contact for the network in your region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor and analyse portfolio performance metrics, sharing data-led insights with partners to identify growth opportunities and improve satisfaction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Negotiation:&lt;/strong&gt; Negotiate contract terms and conditions to align with company goals, improving financial performance and our Consumer Value Proposition (CVP).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Planning:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and execute portfolio strategies to increase market share and loyalty, impacting both absolute performance and relative financial metrics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;P&amp;amp;L Oversight:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage and control the perimeter P&amp;amp;L, identifying potential financial risks and unlocking new revenue opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ideal candidate will bring strong expertise in some of these areas and curiosity to grow in others:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Significant experience in account management or sales, ideally within the Horeca, restaurant, or food market sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong understanding of P&amp;amp;L management and a proven ability to handle complex commercial negotiations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relationship building:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to create and maintain long-term strategic relationships with external stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic project management:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience using CRM tools and project management applications to guide best practices and portfolio strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluency in Italian and a strong professional command of English to collaborate with our global teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Make a visible impact every day&lt;/strong&gt; Your work directly improves experiences for customers, partners and riders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;Learn fast in an entrepreneurial environment&lt;/strong&gt; Work close to the market with autonomy, pace and real responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Build a career, not just a role&lt;/strong&gt; Stretch yourself, develop new skills and grow as the business evolves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;Deliver together in an inclusive culture&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborative, values-driven teams that support how you work best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about how we hire&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/how-we-hire/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; &lt;u&gt;here&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;National Collective Agreement (CBA):&lt;/strong&gt; CCNL Commercio e Terziario&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Classification Level:&lt;/strong&gt; Livello 3&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The total target compensation (OTE (On-Target Earnings, ovvero la retribuzione totale prevista al raggiungimento del 100% degli obiettivi) for this role is €36,000 – €45,000 gross per year, of which the base salary range is €31,320 – €39,150. &lt;br&gt;The successful candidate&#39;s starting pay will fall within the pay range listed above and is determined based on a number of job-related factors including, but not limited to, skills, experience, qualifications, work location, and market conditions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is not eligible for consideration for an equity/RSU grant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To learn more about our benefits, please do not hesitate to bring this up with your Talent Acquisition Partner!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate&#39;s starting pay will fall within the pay range listed below and is determined based on a number of job-related factors including, but not limited to, skills, experience, qualifications, work location, and market conditions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is not eligible for consideration for an equity/RSU grant.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€36.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€45.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
