&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi Deliveroo ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lorsque l&#39;on vous dit Deliveroo, vous imaginez sans doute d&#39;abord les bons petits plats livrés chez vous en moins d&#39;une demi-heure. Plutôt sympa non ? Mais c&#39;est en coulisses que l&#39;histoire est la plus intéressante. Nous opérons désormais à travers le monde et travaillons avec plus de 176 000 restaurants partenaires et commerces en tous genres en France. Nous collaborons avec des milliers de livreurs et de livreuses partenaires pour le plus grand bonheur de nos millions de personnes clientes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous recherchons un·e Assistant·e Chef de Projet Marketing Merchant en alternance pour rejoindre notre équipe Marketing à Paris, pour une durée de 12 mois. Aux côtés de l&#39;équipe Merchant, vous contribuerez au développement de la croissance de nos partenaires, au déploiement de nos campagnes nationales 360° et en accompagnerez des projets à fort impact sur l&#39;acquisition, la rétention et la fidélisation de nos restaurants partenaires.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Descriptif du poste :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant qu’Apprenti(e) dans l’équipe Marketing Merchant Restaurant, vous travaillerez au quotidien avec l&#39;équipe marketing chargée de mettre en avant toute la sélection de restaurants et de partenaires de Deliveroo. Vous serez également amené(e) à &lt;strong&gt;interagir régulièrement avec les autres départements marketing &lt;/strong&gt;tels que l’équipe média, l’équipe créative, le CRM ainsi qu’avec l’&lt;strong&gt;équipe commerciale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos missions consisteront à:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mettre en avant sur l’application les restaurants et partenaires disponibles sur l’app.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Soutenir l’équipe commerciale dans la création et l’exécution de plans marketing destinés à mettre en avant les partenaires présents sur Deliveroo.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborer étroitement avec l&#39;équipe commerciale et les équipes marketing transversales (marque, réseaux sociaux, CRM et influenceurs) pour développer et exécuter des plans partenaires basés sur les priorités commerciales (par exemple, objectifs régionaux, accords d&#39;exclusivité, renégociations).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Préparer des présentations et des supports pour appuyer les discussions de l&#39;équipe commerciale avec les partenaires, en veillant à l&#39;alignement et à la clarté.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer à l’exécution des points forts des partenaires en collaboration avec le CRM et le Commercial (communications mensuelles d&#39;exclusivité / bannières dédiées sur l’application / notifications push...).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gérer le budget alloué pour le plan de chaque partenaire, en optimisant les ressources locales pour obtenir un impact maximal.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyser l’impact de nos campagnes pour en tirer des recommandations pour les équipes commerciales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cette alternance vous permettra d&#39;appréhender de nombreux sujets marketing (création de campagne, analyse, sensibilité client) et vous permettra d&#39;acquérir une bonne connaissance des enjeux marketing et de la gestion de projets complexes grâce à la collaboration transverse que vous aurez avec les autres pôles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce qui vous permettra de réussir&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous préparez un diplôme de niveau Bac+4 ou Bac+5 en école de commerce, université ou équivalent, avec une spécialisation en marketing, communication ou digital et recherchez une alternance d&#39;une durée d&#39;un an à partir de Décembre 2026 / Janvier 2027.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vous Vous Reconnaissez Dans Les Points Suivants&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous êtes organisé·e, rigoureux·se et savez gérer plusieurs projets en parallèle en respectant les délais&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez une excellente communication écrite et orale en français ainsi qu&#39;un bon niveau d&#39;anglais.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous êtes à l&#39;aise avec les chiffres et aimez analyser les performances pour en tirer des recommandations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous appréciez le travail en équipe et la coordination de nombreux interlocuteurs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous êtes curieux·se, proactif·ve et souhaitez évoluer dans un environnement dynamique et en forte croissance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Voici un&lt;a href=&quot;https://sites.google.com/deliveroo.co.uk/biz-interview-guide/home?authuser=0&quot;&gt; lien&lt;/a&gt; avec de la documentation pour vous préparer aux entretiens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous offrons un environnement de travail dynamique et stimulant, où vous aurez l&#39;opportunité de développer vos compétences et de contribuer activement à notre mission. Rejoignez notre équipe exceptionnelle dès maintenant et faites partie de cette aventure passionnante !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;La vie chez Deliveroo :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre équipe est en forte croissance, notre impact très important, et nous cherchons à répondre aux questions les plus stimulantes du moment. Nous progressons rapidement, nous explorons toujours de nouvelles idées et nous sommes très transparents quant aux décisions que nous prenons et à ce qui motive nos choix.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Il y a tellement de questions que nous souhaitons résoudre, et encore plus que nous n&#39;avons pas encore rencontrées. Comment les données et la technologie peuvent-elles aider les restaurants à développer leur activité à mesure que les habitudes des consommateurs évoluent ? Comment pouvons-nous prédire ce qu&#39;une personne souhaitera pour dîner avant même que l&#39;idée ne lui vienne à l&#39;esprit ? Chez Deliveroo, ces questions ne sont que quelques-uns des défis ambitieux auxquels nous nous efforçons de répondre – et il n&#39;y a aucun projet qui ne peut pas devenir le vôtre. Aucune solution n&#39;appartient à une équipe en particulier, ce qui vous ouvre d&#39;extraordinaires possibilités en termes de développement et d&#39;impact personnel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;À compétences égales, ce poste est ouvert aux travailleurs et travailleuses en situation de handicap ou assimilés au sens de l’article L5212-13 du Code du travail. Deliveroo s’engage en faveur de la diversité, l’égalité professionnelle, l’emploi des personnes en situation de handicap.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;The Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is on a mission to transform the way the world thinks about food delivery, and B2B marketing is central to how we grow our merchant business. We&#39;re looking for a B2B Demand Generation Manager to own paid demand generation across our operating markets and help us win in one of the most competitive categories in tech. This is a high-autonomy, high-impact role for a seasoned performance marketer who can own demand gen end-to-end — from strategy and channel mix through to creative, execution, and the leads that actually convert into live, revenue-generating merchants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo operates in a focused set of markets, which means local relevance is everything. You&#39;ll work hand-in-hand with country Sales and commercial teams to understand each market&#39;s strategy, adapt the demand gen playbook to local realities, and choose the channels and tactics that will move the needle in each one. Rather than running a single global template, you&#39;ll tailor your approach country by country while building the repeatable systems that let us scale what works.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll manage significant budgets across a broad channel mix (Meta, TikTok, Google, programmatic and beyond) and you&#39;ll be equally comfortable crafting a sharp lead-gen campaign and a brand awareness push to win back share against multiple well-funded competitors. You&#39;ll partner with creatives to shape intelligent, well-positioned campaigns and testing winners, learning with data what works and can be scaled.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be responsible for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Owning end-to-end paid demand generation across our markets and B2B products, managing significant budgets across a broad channel mix (Meta, TikTok, Google, programmatic and beyond), experimenting with locally relevant tactics and turning what works into scalable playbooks;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partnering closely with country Sales and commercial stakeholders to understand local strategy and market dynamics, and adapting the demand gen playbook to each market;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Building a lead generation engine that converts, looking beyond raw lead volume to lead quality, merchants that go live, and the GOV (Gross Order Value) they generate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partnering with creative on full-funnel campaigns and sharp positioning, from lead generation through to brand awareness that defends and grows share in a highly competitive category, working independently with country teams;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Driving automation and AI-assisted workflows to improve efficiency and reduce manual effort;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supporting new product and feature launches with go-to-market demand generation campaigns;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Owning reporting and measurement, defining success from spend through to live merchants and GOV, and building strong relationships with Sales, Product and commercial teams to drive real business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be able to demonstrate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A seasoned performance marketer with 5–8 years running high-budget B2B paid campaigns across multiple channels with real strength in Meta, TikTok and Google Search and across multiple countries, products or clients;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SMB B2B experience: you build lead generation pipelines that convert, thinking beyond the lead to good leads, merchants that go live, and the GOV they generate;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong local and commercial instinct: you work naturally with Sales, adapt to each country&#39;s strategy, and communicate clearly in English (other languages a plus);&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to plan and optimise media investment against business and campaign-level KPIs, and to do in-house media buying;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A spark of creativity and a sharp eye for positioning, you partner with creatives to craft intelligent campaigns and operate independently with country teams;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Analytical and data-driven: you define KPIs, form hypotheses, design tests for statistically significant results, and scale up what works;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Genuine interest in using AI and automation to improve how you work, with concrete examples to back it up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with the Food or Retail industries;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience aligning inbound and outbound motions, and knowledge of data enrichment and attribution (e.g. Clay, Cognism, ZoomInfo), ABM or intent-based tools;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with content syndication, paid PR or retail media.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Make a visible impact every day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your work directly improves experiences for customers, partners and riders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;Learn fast in an entrepreneurial environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work close to the market with autonomy, pace and real responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Build a career, not just a role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stretch yourself, develop new skills and grow as the business evolves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;Deliver together in an inclusive culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborative, values-driven teams that support how you work best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about how we hire&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/how-we-hire/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; &lt;u&gt;here&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agent Experience builds the AI-powered backend services that power agent-assist tooling on our Astra support surface — helping support agents resolve customer, merchant, and Dasher issues faster. We sit at the intersection of LLM-backed product features and high-volume, latency-sensitive support infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain backend services for agent-assist features on Astra, taking on feature-level work with increasing independence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate requirements into working code: design the feature-level approach, write an RFC when the change affects other engineers, and implement it end-to-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate with LLM-backed features — wiring up prompt/completion calls, handling provider responses, and validating output quality and correctness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Break down assigned project work into tasks, provide accurate estimates, and keep your own progress and dependencies on track.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply AI tooling thoughtfully to your own workflow (coding, testing, review) and critically evaluate its output rather than taking it at face value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in code review — both giving and receiving — to help the team hold a high bar for correctness, quality, and standards compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with senior engineers and partner teams to clarify problem definitions, unblock yourself, and flag risks or blockers early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid backend engineering fundamentals in Go, with experience shipping and maintaining production services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to LLM-powered features in production (prompt/completion integration, provider APIs) is a plus — we&#39;ll ramp you up if you haven&#39;t worked with this directly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to independently own feature-level work: from a written requirement to tested, shipped code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working in a domain with multiple chat/support surfaces — willingness to trace issues to the right service rather than guessing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear technical writing (RFCs for feature-level decisions) and good judgment about when to ask for help versus push forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–4 years of backend engineering experience, with a track record of growing ownership and scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Deliveroo:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is an award-winning online food delivery company on a mission to bring the world&#39;s best-loved local restaurants directly to people&#39;s doors. With a network of high-quality restaurants, riders, and customers, we&#39;re making fast food delivery a seamless experience worldwide. We are a rapidly growing company with a huge ambition, and we&#39;re always looking for top talent to join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Dutch speaking, highly motivated and results-oriented &lt;strong&gt;Business Development Associate&lt;/strong&gt; to join our expanding team in Belgium. In this role, you will be instrumental in driving Deliveroo&#39;s growth by proactively identifying, engaging, and onboarding new restaurant and food business partners (including supermarkets, butchers, bakeries, etc.) onto the Deliveroo platform. Your primary focus will be on building strong relationships with potential partners and showcasing the value proposition of partnering with Deliveroo in Antwerp, Bruges and&amp;nbsp;Ghent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Actively identify and prospect potential restaurant and food business partners within your assigned territory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Conduct outreach (via phone, email, and in-person meetings) to introduce Deliveroo and its benefits to prospective partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Present Deliveroo&#39;s value proposition clearly and persuasively, addressing the specific needs and concerns of each business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Manage the full sales cycle from initial contact to successful onboarding of new partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Build and maintain a strong pipeline of qualified leads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Negotiate partnership terms and agreements to achieve mutually beneficial outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Collaborate closely with internal teams (e.g., Onboarding, Account Management) to ensure a smooth and successful launch for new partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Stay up-to-date on market trends, competitor activities, and the local food and beverage landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Meet and exceed targets for new partner acquisition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Maintain accurate records of sales activities and progress within CRM systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &lt;strong&gt;Native Dutch speaker&lt;/strong&gt; is essential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Fluency in &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt; is required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Proficiency in &lt;strong&gt;French&lt;/strong&gt; is a strong plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Proven &lt;strong&gt;sales experience&lt;/strong&gt; is a significant advantage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• A genuine &lt;strong&gt;passion for food&lt;/strong&gt; and the restaurant/grocery industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Strong communication, negotiation, and interpersonal skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Self-motivated, proactive, and target-driven with a strong work ethic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Excellent organizational and time-management skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Ability to work independently and as part of a team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Valid driver&#39;s license and willingness to travel locally as needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• The opportunity to work for a fast-growing and exciting global company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• A dynamic and collaborative work environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Competitive salary and benefits package (including car allowance).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Opportunities for professional development and growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• The chance to make a real impact on Deliveroo&#39;s success in Belgium.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
