&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will need to be comfortable with negotiations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Knowledge of the restaurant industry is a significant plus&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
