&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Business Development Manager based in Rome.&amp;nbsp;This is a rare opportunity to become a founding and important member of a growing, well-funded company. You&#39;ll collaborate with Italy&#39;s most premium and regarded restaurants.&amp;nbsp;As a member of the regional sales team, you will report to the Sales Lead, and your role will focus on developing new relationships with restaurants and stores.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Map, prospect, pitch and close new restaurants across your region in an organised fashion. This means being an area-level expert, including knowing the up-and-coming restaurants and which restaurants customers crave most&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support partners in joining Deliveroo, providing the best experience to them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate (physical visits, email, calls, or social media) with restaurants to demonstrate Deliveroo technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help restaurant owners/managers overcome any barriers or hesitations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attend restaurant and food meet-ups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
