&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Commercial Project Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team. In this role, you will be the engine behind our local growth, leading high-impact commercial projects and using data-driven insights to refine our Consumer Value Proposition (CVP).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Get to know our &lt;a class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/the-commercial-team/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Commercial&lt;/a&gt; team — what drives us, how we work, and what you can expect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead the end-to-end execution of strategic initiatives, acting as the connective tissue between Marketing, Operations, and Account Management. This role is a blend of project management, commercial strategy, and data analysis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Project Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead key commercial projects from planning and delivery tracking to post-implementation reviews.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Orchestration:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the primary bridge between Marketing, Operations, and Account Management to ensure campaigns and shared priorities are executed seamlessly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CVP Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Use data and analysis to refine our Consumer Value Proposition, focusing on selection, affordability, and overall customer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Intelligence:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor competitor moves and market trends to inform strategic planning and stay ahead of the curve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the reporting for growth and CVP metrics, providing the business with the data needed for evidence-based decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go-To-Market Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the local rollout of cross-functional initiatives, ensuring effective coordination across all departments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ideal candidate will bring strong expertise in some of these areas and curiosity to grow in others:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Minimum 4 years of work experience, with at least 2 years specifically in project management or commercial strategy roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Prowess:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency in Excel/Google Sheets and a track record of using data to drive commercial outcomes. Experience with &lt;strong&gt;Looker&lt;/strong&gt; is a strong plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; A pragmatic problem-solver who can navigate ambiguity and prioritise effectively in a high-growth environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Effective Communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent interpersonal skills with the ability to influence cross-functional stakeholders and coordinate complex teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Literacy:&lt;/strong&gt; A good understanding of P&amp;amp;L dynamics and financial modelling is preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience in marketplace, consumer tech, FMCG, or consulting is highly desirable.&lt;/p&gt;
