&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo for Work (DfW) is on a mission to deliver amazing experiences in the workplace and improve employee wellbeing. We bring the neighbourhood to your office, partnering with over 20,000 companies across Europe and the Middle East, simplifying the way they fund food for their employees and clients. The growth opportunity within this region remains huge, with 2026 being a crucial year to scale the business. Find out more about DfW and the services we provide here:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://work.deliveroo.ae/&quot;&gt;https://work.deliveroo.ae/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Corporate Account Manager role is an integral part of our B2B team in the UAE, with the primary responsibility of managing, retaining, and upselling a portfolio of corporate clients. This role will predominantly focus on building relationships with senior corporate stakeholders across mid-market clients, and will suit a highly organised and collaborative individual who prides themselves on delivering an exceptional level of service for their accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Setting up meetings and video calls with corporate POCs to review their spend, while pitching new use-cases, upselling and cross-selling accounts wherever possible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hitting assigned monthly KPIs, including meetings, GOV, and MAUs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing account support wherever required, such as sharing order reports, finding solutions for minor technical issues, and supporting with organising client events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilising Salesforce, Google Sheets, Looker, and AI tools to track, report, and present to leadership on performance and growth strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assisting with ad hoc tasks that fall under DfW’s scope, such as attending trade events, assisting with marketing activations, partnerships with the restaurant team, and chasing client payments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills in English are a must; Arabic is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of B2B account management experience, with a demonstrated track record of growing a portfolio through a consultative and data-driven approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in Dubai&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly proficient in using Salesforce and Google Sheets/Slides&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly proactive, quick learner, team player, and thrives within a fast-paced startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders, and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here, you can expect to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔧 &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make a visible impact every day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Your work directly improves experiences for customers, partners and riders.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Learn fast in an entrepreneurial environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Work close to the market with autonomy, pace and real responsibility.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧠&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build a career, not just a role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Stretch yourself, develop new skills and grow as the business evolves.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌎 &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver together in an inclusive culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Collaborative, values-driven teams that support how you work best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find out more about how we hire&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/how-we-hire/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Deliveroo for Work (DfW) is on a mission to deliver amazing experiences in the workplace and improve employee wellbeing. We bring the neighbourhood to your office, partnering with over 20,000 companies across Europe and the Middle East, simplifying the way they fund food for their employees and clients. The growth opportunity within this region remains huge, with 2026 being a crucial year to scale the business. Find out more about DfW and the services we provide here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://work.deliveroo.ae/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;https://work.deliveroo.ae/&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Role &lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;The Corporate Commercial Manager role is an integral part of our B2B team in the Middle East, with the responsibility of building, retaining, and upselling a portfolio of corporate clients that will drive incremental revenue for DfW. This role will predominantly focus on Abu Dhabi and requires someone with a real hunter mentality, who is confident in getting meetings booked with key decision makers and building relationships with senior corporate stakeholders, across target companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Growing a comprehensive sales pipeline in Abu Dhabi by identifying and building relationships with senior stakeholders working at companies across different zones and industries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prospecting through utilising various B2B lead gen databases, plus a combination of cold-calling, email outreach, and networking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Creating bespoke pitch decks and commercial quotations based on specific client use-cases, and handling commercial negotiations to convert target accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Setting up meetings and calls with corporate decision makers to review their spend, while pitching new use-cases, upselling and cross-selling accounts wherever possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hitting assigned monthly KPIs including calls, meetings, activation rate, and GOV.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Utilising Salesforce, Google Sheets, Looker, and AI tools to track, report and present on performance, pipeline, and growth strategies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Assisting with ad hoc tasks that fall under DfW’s scope, such as attending trade events, assisting with marketing activations, providing data reports, and chasing overdue client invoices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills in English is a must. Arabic is a huge plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3+ years of B2B commercial experience, with a demonstrated track record of driving revenue growth through a consultative and data-driven approach.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based in Abu Dhabi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Highly proficient using Salesforce and Google Sheets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Self-motivated, proactive, and able to take initiative when working autonomously.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quick-learner, team-player, and thrives within a fast-paced startup environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor degree preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Why Deliveroo&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Our mission is to transform the way you shop and eat, bringing the neighbourhood to your door by connecting consumers, restaurants, shops and riders. We give people the opportunity to buy what they want, as they want it, when and where they want it. We are a technology-driven company at the forefront of the most rapidly expanding industry in the world. We are still a small team, making a very large impact, looking to answer some of the most interesting questions out there. We move fast, value autonomy and ownership, and we are always looking for new talent with new ideas.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Corporate Commercial Manager - Deliveroo for Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation, and growth drives everything we do. Our Commercial team sits at the centre of Deliveroo’s marketplace—shaping how we serve restaurants, grocers, and new verticals worldwide. From negotiating key partnerships to unlocking new revenue streams and crafting data-led growth strategies, we take on big challenges that move the business forward. If you thrive in fast-paced, commercial environments and want to influence the future of a global brand—this is the team for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a Corporate Commercial Manager to join our London team. This is a hybrid role. In this role, you’ll help us lead both the acquisition and ongoing management of a high-value corporate portfolio, directly driving client growth and expanding our platform presence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Get to know our Commercial team — what drives us, how we work, and what you can expect. &lt;a class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/the-commercial-team/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/the-commercial-team/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;You’ll be joining the Deliveroo for Work (DfW) team. DfW is Deliveroo’s B2B arm, offering simple and flexible food-spending solutions to corporate clients across seven global markets, from team lunches and office events to pantry supplies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Acquire Corporate Clients:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead end-to-end sales cycles to convert and onboard high-value corporate clients onto the Deliveroo for Work platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage High-Value Accounts:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee a dedicated account portfolio, driving contract renewals, retention, and growth by deepening relationships with key decision-makers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design Bespoke Commercial Solutions:&lt;/strong&gt; Craft tailored propositions aligned with client requirements, structuring optimal pricing, rollout plans, and integration models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Navigate Complex Stakeholder Environments:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Product, Engineering, Legal, and Security teams to solve technical requirements and unblock deals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Product Feedback:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the voice of corporate customers, synthesising client requirements to inform and influence our product roadmap priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;Our ideal candidate will bring strong expertise in some of these areas and curiosity to grow in others:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;B2B Sales &amp;amp; Account Management Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Proven track record in closing B2B agreements, expanding client portfolios, and consistently exceeding targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Navigating Complex Deals:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable managing sales cycles involving procurement, legal, security, and compliance stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Product Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to engage credibly with technical partners and translate product capabilities into clear commercial value propositions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;17&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Influence: &lt;/strong&gt;Strong relationship-building skills with a demonstrated ability to influence key cross-functional decision-makers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Acumen &amp;amp; Resilience:&lt;/strong&gt; Sharp commercial judgement to structure deals alongside a disciplined, structured approach to pipeline management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;19&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20&quot;&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;21&quot;&gt;🔧 Make a visible impact every day Your work directly improves experiences for customers, partners and riders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;22&quot;&gt;🌱 Learn fast in an entrepreneurial environment Work close to the market with autonomy, pace and real responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;23&quot;&gt;🧠 Build a career, not just a role Stretch yourself, develop new skills and grow as the business evolves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;24&quot;&gt;🌎 Deliver together in an inclusive culture Collaborative, values-driven teams that support how you work best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_7f63d9153c878594-120&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;25&quot;&gt;We aim t&lt;span class=&quot;citation-434 citation-435 citation-end-435&quot;&gt;o create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about how we hire here.&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-434 citation-end-434&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;25&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-432 citation-433 citation-end-433&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-432 citation-end-432&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;26&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-430 citation-431 citation-end-431&quot;&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-430 citation-end-430&quot;&gt; with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates,&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; systems&lt;span class=&quot;citation-428 citation-429 citation-end-429&quot;&gt;, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mid-Market Corporate Sales Lead&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation, and growth drives everything we do. Our Commercial team sits at the centre of Deliveroo’s marketplace—shaping how we serve restaurants, grocers, and new verticals worldwide. From negotiating key partnerships to unlocking new revenue streams and crafting data-led growth strategies, we take on big challenges that move the business forward. If you thrive in fast-paced, commercial environments and want to influence the future of a global brand—this is the team for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a Mid-Market Corporate Sales Lead to join our London team. This is a hybrid role. In this role, you’ll help us lead a small team of BDMs and deliver the mid-market new business target through your own pipeline and your team&#39;s performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Get to know our Commercial team — what drives us, how we work, and what you can expect. &lt;a class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/the-commercial-team/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/the-commercial-team/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;You’ll be joining the Deliveroo for Work (DfW) UKI team. Deliveroo for Work is Deliveroo’s B2B arm, offering simple and flexible food-spending solutions to corporate clients across seven global markets. From team lunches to late-night meals to office events and even pantry supplies - Deliveroo for Work has every business food need covered.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Business Target:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the mid-market new business target for the UK, delivered through a combination of your own sales and your team&#39;s performance, building strong relationships with decision-makers and uncovering growth opportunities using data-driven insights. Monitor pipeline performance through key metrics to identify trends, risks, and growth levers to develop tailored strategies to maximise new business revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead, coach, and nurture a small team of BDMs, setting clear direction and priorities, and supporting their development to help them thrive and deliver against their targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Vision: &lt;/strong&gt;Own the mid-market new business strategy, leveraging commercial data, prospect behaviour insights, and market performance analysis to identify growth levers and performance risks. Translate complex pipeline trends into clear, actionable recommendations that inform decision-making and drive measurable commercial outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Sales:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop deep expertise in the DfW product suite to advise prospects on best-practice usage. Build credibility as a trusted technical partner by proactively identifying risks, troubleshooting issues, and driving timely resolution to ensure a seamless prospect experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and maintain strong, multi-level relationships with key stakeholders across prospect organisations and internal teams, acting as the primary point of contact throughout the sales process. Understand stakeholders and their priorities, tailoring engagement and communication to secure buy-in, resolve issues quickly, and unlock new growth opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with Marketing, Tech, Finance, and Global Commercial teams to represent your pipeline’s priorities. Translate new business performance insights into clear requirements, influence roadmaps and campaigns, and ensure initiatives are aligned to UK growth objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;Our ideal candidate will bring strong expertise in some of these areas and curiosity to grow in others:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot;&gt;Commercially minded with strong commercial instinct and a passion for driving growth and taking full ownership of targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16&quot;&gt;A natural people leader with high EQ, who inspires trust, coaches with empathy, and brings out the best in their team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;17&quot;&gt;Data-driven operator comfortable working with large data sets and confident in translating metrics to shape sales plans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18&quot;&gt;Exceptional stakeholder management and communication skills, with a proven ability to engage quickly, build strong relationships, and influence across all levels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;19&quot;&gt;Solutions-focused, curious, and proactive mindset, comfortable moving with pace and thriving in fast-growing environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;21&quot;&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;22&quot;&gt;🔧 Make a visible impact every day Your work directly improves experiences for customers, partners and riders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;23&quot;&gt;🌱 Learn fast in an entrepreneurial environment Work close to the market with autonomy, pace and real responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;24&quot;&gt;🧠 Build a career, not just a role Stretch yourself, develop new skills and grow as the business evolves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;25&quot;&gt;🌎 Deliver together in an inclusive culture Collaborative, values-driven teams that support how you work best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_d952c929dd54441d-99&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;26&quot;&gt;We aim t&lt;span class=&quot;citation-376 citation-377 citation-end-377&quot;&gt;o create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about how we hire here.&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-376 citation-end-376&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
