&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consultative Selling:&lt;/strong&gt; Build relationships with restaurant owners, advising them on how Deliveroo’s technology and logistics can scale their revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage your sales leads, stay organized, and build daily action plans to meet and exceed monthly targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
