&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Linguistic Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluency in &lt;strong&gt;French and English&lt;/strong&gt; (written and spoken) is essential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resilience:&lt;/strong&gt; The confidence to make regular cold calls and spend several hours a day engaging with prospects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organization:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to manage a high volume of leads and paperwork accurately.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; An eagerness to develop professionally; we provide the training, you provide the drive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Spirit:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to thrive both individually and as part of a high-energy team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
