&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketing Intern&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo Belgium, our marketing team is evolving, and with it, the opportunity for a curious and enthusiastic intern to grow alongside us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;flexible, eager-to-learn Marketing Intern&lt;/strong&gt; who will play a key role in &lt;strong&gt;frontline marketing operations&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This internship is designed for someone who may not yet have a fully defined skillset, but who is excited to understand how a fast-growing business operates. We’ll be there to share our knowledge, guide you, and help you develop strong &lt;strong&gt;business acumen&lt;/strong&gt; with &lt;strong&gt;real impact&lt;/strong&gt; from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Frontline Marketing Operations (core responsibility)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the day-to-day execution of marketing campaigns, helping ensure initiatives are launched accurately and on time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the localisation and adaptation of marketing content and assets for the Belgian market, including centrally led initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide operational support for CRM campaigns and assets, helping prepare, localise, review, and coordinate customer communications across relevant channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and push live in-app messaging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate marketing assets and copy across English, French, and Dutch, ensuring content is locally relevant and consistent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform quality checks on campaign assets, copy, links, and placements before launch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a key operational link between ideas, content, tools, and execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exposure to Marketing Strategy &amp;amp; Business Thinking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the Merchant Marketing team and wider marketing stakeholders on various initiatives as the team’s scope evolves&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the preparation of presentations, campaign materials, and updates for internal stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain exposure to how marketing initiatives connect to broader commercial and business objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help identify opportunities to improve and streamline recurring marketing processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain hands-on exposure to how a country-level team thinks about growth, customers, merchants, and performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn how to structure problems, prioritize work, and translate ideas into action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop practical experience with CRM, localisation, campaign execution, and marketing operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Progressively take on more ownership and responsibility as your confidence and understanding grow&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not looking for a “perfect” profile, we’re looking for &lt;strong&gt;potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You might be a great fit if you are:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, proactive, and motivated to learn quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable asking questions and open to feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organized and reliable, with a strong eye for detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with content and checking that the small details are right&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to adapt in a fast-moving environment where priorities and projects can evolve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Happy to combine creative marketing tasks with hands-on operational execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently studying towards a Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Belgium (e.g. business, economics, marketing, communications, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Available for a &lt;strong&gt;6-month internship&lt;/strong&gt;, with potential extension up to 12 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in &lt;strong&gt;English, French, and Dutch&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic familiarity with tools such as Google Sheets and presentation software is helpful&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience with CRM or marketing tools is a plus, but not required — we’ll help you learn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll gain&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;hands-on, high-exposure internship&lt;/strong&gt; in a fast-growing international company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience across marketing operations, CRM, localisation, and campaign execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A steep learning curve with tangible impact on the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to both the operational and strategic sides of marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A vibrant and friendly office environment in Brussels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities for both personal and professional development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;And yes, great food 🍕&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Deliveroo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is on a mission to transform the way people experience food. We combine operational excellence with bold thinking, moving fast while staying detail-oriented. Every day brings new challenges and opportunities to grow, and we’re looking for people who want to grow with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This internship is an ideal starting point for students who want to &lt;strong&gt;learn by doing&lt;/strong&gt;, understand how marketing and strategy work in practice, and make a meaningful contribution early in their career.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation and growth drive everything we do. Our Global Engineering teams tackle complex technical challenges across a global, three-sided marketplace, building and scaling systems that serve millions of customers, riders and partners every day.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Machine Learning Engineer to join our London office as part of a Global DoorDash Engineering team (working hybrid, 3 days in the office).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Our New Verticals team exists to grow monthly active usage outside of restaurant ordering — groceries, retail, and everything in between. That means turning someone who only orders restaurant food into someone who also uses the app for a grocery run, and turning dormant users into active ones. You&#39;ll work on the surfaces that make that happen: the homepage, vertical landing pages, and the notifications that bring people back. This role sits closer to the personalisation and ranking side of that mission, working alongside colleagues across DoorDash, Deliveroo and Wolt.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Build and improve ranking models for vertical landing pages (grocery, retail), deciding what a user sees first when they land on a store page&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Design models that blend new-vertical content into a homepage built around restaurant ordering, without disrupting the core experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Build personalisation models that translate a user&#39;s existing behaviour into relevant recommendations for verticals they haven&#39;t tried yet&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Contribute to notification targeting — who gets notified, with what message, and when, to drive adoption of new verticals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Minimum 3+ years of experience as an ML Engineer or Data Scientist, with a proven ability to write high-quality production code in Python&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience with end-to-end model productionisation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;A bias to simplicity, where you care most about achieving impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Background in personalisation, ranking, or recommender systems; exposure to causal inference or uplift modelling is a genuine plus but not expected&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Deliveroo, you&#39;ll do work that matters—solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that&#39;s constantly evolving. We&#39;re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;🔧 Solve meaningful problems at real scale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;🌱 See your impact, fast&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ship, test and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;🧠 Grow through challenge and ownership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;🌎 A culture built for builders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;High standards, collaboration, flexible working and continuous learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;💰 Share in the success you help create&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and equity options, so you&#39;re rewarded for the impact you make.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;➡️ Want a deeper look at how we build? Check out our Tech Blog.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
