&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Marketing Intern&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation, and growth drives everything we do. Our Brand &amp;amp; Experience team builds the emotional connection between Deliveroo and our customers, riders, and partners. With a deep understanding of our audience and a passion for creativity, we bring our brand to life across every touchpoint. Whether it’s a push notification, social campaign, or packaging design—we craft compelling experiences that shape perceptions, spark engagement, and make Deliveroo a loved, global brand. We’re looking for a Marketing Intern to join our team. In this role, you’ll gain hands-on experience supporting a variety of projects, from social media coordination to community engagement, helping us grow our brand presence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be joining the Brand &amp;amp; Experience team. We are a creative and fast-paced group dedicated to making Deliveroo the world’s most loved delivery brand. You will play a key role in assisting with day-to-day tasks and contributing to the success of our local marketing efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Campaigns: Assist in the planning and organisation of key marketing campaigns, collaborating across the team to ensure smooth execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate Social Media: Build monthly content schedules and coordinate filming opportunities with internal teams and external agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage Ambassadors: Help manage partnerships with brand ambassadors, including coordination, performance tracking, and planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Community Engagement: Interact with our audience by responding to messages and comments, actively seeking ways to increase brand visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create Content: Support the team with the creation and distribution of engaging content across multiple digital channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Essential Educational Background: Currently pursuing a degree in Marketing, Communications, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organisation Skills: Proven ability to manage multiple tasks and stay organised in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication: Excellent written and verbal communication skills with a keen eye for detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Digital Savvy: A strong understanding of social media platforms and current digital trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive Mindset: An enthusiastic, &quot;can-do&quot; attitude with a genuine eagerness to learn and take on new challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using content creation tools (e.g., Canva, CapCut, or Adobe Suite).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in a customer-facing or community-focused role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Working here you can expect to:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 Make a visible impact every day Your work directly improves experiences for customers, partners and riders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 Learn fast in an entrepreneurial environment Work close to the market with autonomy, pace and real responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 Build a career, not just a role Stretch yourself, develop new skills and grow as the business evolves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 Deliver together in an inclusive culture Collaborative, values-driven teams that support how you work best.&lt;/p&gt;
