&lt;p&gt;You’ll be joining the Central CRM team. This position will be part of the Central CRM team, composed of 30+ specialists in CRM, dedicated to executing campaigns for the UAE as well as supporting global strategic initiatives. The team collectively strives to expand our subscriber base and enhance engagement metrics, with a primary focus on retaining Deliveroo customers. Serving as the voice of the customer, the CRM team directs efforts toward enhancing personalised user experiences, activating best-in-class CRM and supporting marketing initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;
