&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Marketing Executive, Restaurant Marketing to join our Marketing team in Kuwait. This is a hybrid role. In this role, you’ll help us grow awareness, demand and orders by delivering best-in-class co-marketing and promotional programmes with our restaurant partners across Kuwait.&lt;/p&gt;
