&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Marketing Executive, Value &amp;amp; Promotions to join our Marketing Team in Dubai. This is a hybrid role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;min-height: 1.2em; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Marketing Executive, Value &amp;amp; Promotions, you will report to the Senior Marketing Manager, Value &amp;amp; Promotions for the Middle East. You will own the day-to-day delivery and performance of our promotional and incentive campaigns, working cross-functionally to ensure every offer is targeted, well-timed, and commercially sound.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Incentives sit at the centre of how customers experience value on the platform - they influence whether someone tries the app, comes back, or drifts away. This role owns that layer day to day: turning the promotional calendar into targeted campaigns across the customer lifecycle, and making sure every campaign earns its budget.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;min-height: 1.2em; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be joining the Middle East Marketing team. You will work cross-functionally with Commercial, Marketing, Finance, Tech, Data Science, and Global/Central teams to build promotional plans that improve customer experience and drive operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;min-height: 1.2em; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s What Your Day-to-day Might Look Like:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;min-height: 1.2em; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Promotional Calendar Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the day-to-day execution of the Middle East promotional calendar, translating the quarterly plan into targeted campaigns across the customer lifecycle: acquisition, activation, retention, and win-back.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Promo Strategy Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to the development of strategies focused on how value propositions can change customer behavior and drive ROI for Deliveroo and our Partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CRM &amp;amp; Lifecycle Campaigns:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with CRM and Tech to build and deploy in-app and lifecycle campaigns, ensuring offers reach the right customer segment at the right moment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Campaign Set-up &amp;amp; Accuracy:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the set-up of promotions end to end - eligibility, caps, dates, and copy - so every offer goes live as briefed and on time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-centric Programmes:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with Data Science to translate customer and performance data into promo mechanics that are genuinely relevant, not just discounted.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Budget Tracking:&lt;/strong&gt; Own campaign-level budget tracking and reporting, flagging when a promotion’s ROI or margin impact is off plan.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Own weekly reporting on in-flight campaign performance and post-campaign analysis, identifying what worked, what didn’t, and what’s worth testing next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test &amp;amp; Learn Agenda:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and run local test-and-learn experiments, feeding results back into the broader promotional strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competition Monitoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Keep on top of competitor trends and market activity to keep our offers sharp and well-positioned.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Advocacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Champion the consumer voice, ensuring every promotion offers genuine value rather than just a lower price.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;min-height: 1.2em; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Need to Thrive:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;min-height: 1.2em; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 2-4 years of experience in Growth Marketing, CRM, Campaign Management, Marketing, Commercial Strategy, or Promotions within a high-growth technology, marketplace, e-commerce, or consumer platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience owning or supporting customer incentive strategies and promotional campaigns that drive measurable business outcomes, with working knowledge of core commercial metrics (CAC, LTV, GMV, margin impact) and how promotional decisions move them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Educational Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor’s degree in Marketing, Business, Economics, Analytics, or a related discipline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Rigor:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong analytical skills - proficient in Excel, Google Sheets, and BI tools like Looker, and comfortable interpreting data to shape campaign decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical know-how:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience running or supporting A/B tests and translating results into recommendations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attention to Detail:&lt;/strong&gt; Organised and accurate, able to run several campaigns at once without letting the details slip.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to manage multiple cross-functional stakeholders and the confidence to communicate at all levels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execution Focus:&lt;/strong&gt; A self-starter attitude, with a proven ability to deliver results quickly and efficiently in a fast-paced, matrixed organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent English; Arabic language skills are an advantage in this market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;min-height: 1.2em; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us? &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Make a visible impact every day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your work directly improves experiences for customers, partners and riders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;Learn fast in an entrepreneurial environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work close to the market with autonomy, pace and real responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Build a career, not just a role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stretch yourself, develop new skills and grow as the business evolves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;Deliver together in an inclusive culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborative, values-driven teams that support how you work best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about how we hire &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/how-we-hire/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation, and growth drives everything we do. At Deliveroo, Marketing plays a key role in driving growth and shaping how customers experience our brand. We work across local and global teams, combining strategic thinking, creativity and a strong understanding of e-commerce to solve business challenges and deliver best-in-class marketing campaigns. If you’re entrepreneurial, hands-on and passionate about building brands and driving growth in a fast-paced environment, this is the team for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Marketing Manager to join our Milan team. This is a hybrid role. In this role, you’ll help us build, scale, and optimize co-marketing strategies with our key restaurant and grocery partners, driving mutual growth and maximizing brand visibility across Italy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be joining the Partner Marketing team. This team bridges the gap between our commercial business partners and our marketing engine, creating high-visibility marketing collaborations that delight customers and accelerate marketplace performance through partners growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead end-to-end co-marketing strategies:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and execute joint marketing strategies with top tier restaurant partners to drive customer acquisition, order growth and partner performance, ensuring partner marketing plans and campaigns calendar are fully integrated with Deliveroo’s broader marketing strategy and priorities while leveraging local markets dynamics, seasonal opportunities and partner’s priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage commercial marketing relationships:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the primary marketing point of contact for key account stakeholders, pitching opportunities and aligning promotional roadmaps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimize partner campaign performance:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor real-time performance indicators and campaign metrics, utilizing data-driven insights to continuously iterate marketing tactics and maximize shared ROI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Monitor and manage relevant marketing budgets&lt;/strong&gt;, tracking monthly spend and ensuring effective budget allocation in line with campaign plans and business priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally:&lt;/strong&gt; Work alongside central creative, local account management, and analytics teams to ensure partner initiatives align perfectly with national brand playbooks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ideal candidate will bring strong expertise in some of these areas and curiosity to grow in others:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5-6 years of experience in Trade or Partner Marketing departments &lt;/strong&gt;within fast paced environments across FMCG, e-commerce, tech or retail with a proven track record of developing and managing successful co-marketing campaigns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong understanding of the Italian commercial landscape:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep familiarity with regional consumer behaviors, retail promotions, and local media channels across major Italian cities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven ability to manage external stakeholders:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional communication, pitching, and relationship-management skills to successfully guide commercial conversations with enterprise partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-driven mindset with commercial acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfort interpreting data sets to evaluate campaign effectiveness, optimize attribution, and report performance clearly to partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Self-starter with an adaptable and proactive mindset&lt;/strong&gt;, comfortable navigating constant change, making sound decisions in a fast-paced environment and taking ownership in dynamic situations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency in both English and Italian:&lt;/strong&gt; Full professional proficiency in both written and spoken languages to ensure seamless collaboration across local and global team structures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Make a visible impact every day&lt;/strong&gt; Your work directly improves experiences for customers, partners and riders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;Learn fast in an entrepreneurial environment&lt;/strong&gt; Work close to the market with autonomy, pace and real responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Build a career, not just a role&lt;/strong&gt; Stretch yourself, develop new skills and grow as the business evolves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;Deliver together in an inclusive culture&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborative, values-driven teams that support how you work best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about how we hire here.&lt;/p&gt;
