&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an &lt;strong&gt;Italian Speaking Inside Sales Representative&lt;/strong&gt; to join our &lt;strong&gt;United Kingdom&lt;/strong&gt; team. In this role, you’ll help us expand our culinary footprint by identifying and onboarding the most popular local restaurants onto the Deliveroo platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Get to know our &lt;a class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/the-commercial-team/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Commercial&lt;/a&gt; team — what drives us, how we work, and what you can expect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be joining the &lt;strong&gt;New Business Development&lt;/strong&gt; team. We are the engine room of Deliveroo’s growth, tasked with discovering the best local eats and convincing them to partner with us to change the landscape of the food industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base salary for this role is &lt;strong&gt;£27,700&lt;/strong&gt;, plus a monthly commission for achieving targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Execute high levels of daily cold-call activity to contact restaurant leads and present partnership opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Own and maintain a robust sales pipeline to consistently exceed monthly acquisition targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consultative Selling:&lt;/strong&gt; Utilise business templates and bespoke proposals to convert prospects into long-term partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Integrity:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain precise records within our CRM to provide full transparency on all sales activities and progress.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Negotiation:&lt;/strong&gt; Passionately represent Deliveroo while resolving objections and negotiating pricing to ensure mutual goals are achieved.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
