&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;UAE National (Emirati)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based in Dubai&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong attention to detail and high level of accuracy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Structured, organized, and process driven&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Analytical mindset with the ability to spot inconsistencies in data&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comfortable working with Google Sheets or Excel including formulas and data manipulation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Able to manage repetitive tasks while maintaining quality&lt;/p&gt;
