&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Backend Engineer to help build and evolve our new Common case-management system, which powers support-case handling across DoorDash, Wolt, and Deliveroo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own significant end-to-end initiatives across our backend services: case lifecycle, routing and assignment, queue management, case evidence and history, and migration from legacy systems. This is a hands-on role for someone who can turn ambiguous customer and operational problems into durable technical solutions, coordinate other engineers, and set the standard for reliability and craftsmanship on the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead one or more project-level Case Management initiatives, on your own or by guiding a group of engineers, from discovery and design through rollout, measurement, and operational ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build scalable backend services and APIs for case creation, routing, assignment, transfers, audit history, notes, attachments, and queue-management workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help deliver feature parity with legacy platforms while safely migrating traffic across DoorDash, Wolt, and Deliveroo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make and own most technical decisions within your scope. Write project-level design documents covering how sub-features interact, identify dependencies and risks, and break work into parallelizable delivery plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scope ambiguous customer and operational problems, weigh long-term against short-term trade-offs, and design durable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Operations, Support, Data, and other engineering teams to define the right problems. Shape the team roadmap through prototypes, data analysis, project proposals, and backlog prioritization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the coordination a project needs, such as status updates and dependency tracking, and escalate early to keep delivery on time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enforce team-wide quality objectives: lead design reviews, calibrate quality metrics, and improve logging, monitoring, alerting, and escalation policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as first responder or incident commander, model good incident practice, and turn what you learn into playbooks and backlog work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Introduce and guide AI best practices for the team, including evals, data privacy, and review of AI-generated code, and take part in AI-powered projects when they are central to the product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design reusable, self-serviceable solutions, and consider cost efficiency, including compute and AI costs, in key designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers through code reviews, design guidance, tech talks, and constructive feedback. Interview candidates, join sell calls, and take part in hiring events when the team needs them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-have qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong backend engineering experience, including designing and operating backend services, APIs, asynchronous workflows, and data models at meaningful scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in at least one modern backend language, and a record of writing exemplary code for the core functionality of key components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ownership of complex, customer-facing or operations-critical projects from technical design through production rollout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience breaking projects into parallelizable work, identifying dependencies and risks, and giving accurate estimates for yourself and others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience using AI development tools to improve productivity, while validating generated output for correctness, security, privacy, maintainability, and reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product judgment: the ability to turn ambiguous workflows and user needs into simple, maintainable technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to collaborate across functions, bring the right stakeholders into decisions at the right time, and explain trade-offs clearly to technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong engineering craft: testing, code review, observability, incident response, security, and operational readiness, with experience designing for reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working on systems with high correctness and auditability requirements, including traceability of decisions and changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A mentoring mindset and a record of raising team-wide engineering standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-have qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Go experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with migration from legacy systems, gradual rollouts, traffic shadowing, and feature-parity programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting internal tools or operational user interfaces from the backend side.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with high-volume, multi-region, or multi-tenant systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as an incident commander or in running an on-call rotation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building AI-powered features, including evaluation of model output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivers a major Case Management initiative with clear technical ownership, predictable execution, and measurable customer or business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improves the reliability, maintainability, and cost efficiency of the Common system while enabling safe migration from legacy case-management systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helps move support traffic onto the Common system without reducing case-resolution quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builds solutions that other engineers and operators can confidently reuse and operate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acts as a technical leader within the team: unblocks peers and partner teams, improves engineering decisions, influences the roadmap, and strengthens cross-functional execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Senior Business Development Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation, and growth drive everything we do. Our Commercial team sits at the centre of Deliveroo’s marketplace—shaping how we serve restaurants, grocers, and new verticals worldwide. From negotiating key partnerships to unlocking new revenue streams and crafting data-led growth strategies, we take on big challenges that move the business forward. If you thrive in fast-paced, commercial environments and want to influence the future of a global brand—this is the team for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;20&quot;&gt;Senior Business Development Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Rome team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;In this role, you’ll help us build new relationships with Rome and Lazio most premium and regarded grocery and stores, acting as a founding member of our regional growth efforts. You will drive both new business acquisition and the direct, hands-on rollout for top accounts with framework agreements already in place at HQ level—visiting individual stores directly to guide their activation process from contract to go-live.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;You will be a critical driver of our expansion in Italy, focusing on high-end partnerships, account activation, and providing a world-class onboarding experience for new merchants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;HQ Contract Rollout &amp;amp; Store Activation:&lt;/strong&gt; Work on existing framework agreements negotiated at Headquarters/Casa Madre level by visiting individual store locations, engaging directly with local store managers, and driving the end-to-end activation process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Consultative Selling &amp;amp; Stakeholder Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Communicate with store managers and business owners through physical in-store visits, calls, and meetings to demonstrate the value of Deliveroo’s technology and ensure buy-in at the local level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Hands-on Onboarding Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Guide partners through the joining and technical setup process, offering on-site support to ensure a seamless operational transition onto the platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Relationship Building:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain strong relationships with local store teams and attend local meet-ups/events to stay connected with the regional retail and culinary community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Market Expertise &amp;amp; Operational Feedback:&lt;/strong&gt; Use your industry knowledge to demonstrate how our products solve real-world challenges for premium partners, gathering local insights to refine our expansion strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;Our ideal candidate will bring strong expertise in some of these areas and curiosity to grow in others:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Sales &amp;amp; Activation Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Significant experience in targeting new business with a &quot;hunter&quot; mindset, combined with a proven track record of executing store-level activations for accounts with central framework agreements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Field &amp;amp; On-Site Availability:&lt;/strong&gt; Willingness and confidence to spend time on the field, visiting individual stores and engaging directly with local managers and operational teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Negotiation &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to navigate commercial discussions centrally and convince local store stakeholders to prioritize platform activation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strong Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Confidence dealing with premium partners face-to-face, over the phone, and via email.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Tenacity &amp;amp; Problem Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; A resilient, proactive approach to overcoming operational barriers at the store level in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Industry Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong understanding of the retail, grocery, or restaurant industry is a significant plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Make a visible impact every day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your work directly improves experiences for customers, partners and riders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;Learn fast in an entrepreneurial environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work close to the market with autonomy, pace and real responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Build a career, not just a role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stretch yourself, develop new skills and grow as the business evolves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;Deliver together in an inclusive culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborative, values-driven teams that support how you work best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3 stages. Find more about how we hire &lt;a class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/how-we-hire/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;National Collective Agreement (CBA):&lt;/strong&gt; CCNL Commercio e Terziario&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Classification Level:&lt;/strong&gt; Livello 3&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The total target compensation (OTE (On-Target Earnings, ovvero la retribuzione totale prevista al raggiungimento del 100% degli obiettivi) for this role is €35,200 – €48,000 gross per year, of which the base salary range is €26,0000 – €30,000. The successful candidate&#39;s starting pay will fall within the pay range listed above and is determined based on a number of job-related factors including, but not limited to, skills, experience, qualifications, work location, and market conditions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is not eligible for consideration for an equity/RSU grant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To learn more about our benefits, please do not hesitate to bring this up with your Talent Acquisition Partner!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate&#39;s starting pay will fall within the pay range listed below and is determined based on a number of job-related factors including, but not limited to, skills, experience, qualifications, work location, and market conditions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is not eligible for consideration for an equity/RSU grant.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€35.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€48.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Deliveroo (part of DoorDash)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo, part of the DoorDash group, is building the leading local commerce platform, connecting consumers, merchants, and couriers in real time. Paris is one of our most strategic and complex markets globally, with unmatched density, brand concentration, and competitive intensity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we move towards our &lt;strong&gt;2026 ambition&lt;/strong&gt;, we are evolving our commercial organisation to match the scale and sophistication required to win in Paris. This includes increased seniority, clearer regional ownership, and stronger execution across Inner and Outer Paris.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Senior Client Partner – Paris Inner Ouest&lt;/strong&gt; role is a newly strengthened position, designed to combine &lt;strong&gt;strategic partner leadership, regional ownership, and organisation building&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Client Partner, you&#39;ll lead a team of Account Management Lead, Senior Account Manager and Account Manager and you will report to the Regional Director of Paris, part of the Commercial team. The position is based in Paris.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are accountable for the &lt;strong&gt;growth and performance of strategic brand portfolios&lt;/strong&gt; across one of Paris’ most critical zones. You will act as the &lt;strong&gt;senior commercial owner&lt;/strong&gt; for your territory, ensuring alignment between Paris-wide strategy and local execution. Beyond partner management, this role plays a central part in &lt;strong&gt;aligning the organisation to business challenges and ambitions&lt;/strong&gt;. You will design, lead, and continuously evolve the account management setup to ensure the right level of seniority, coverage, and execution quality across the territory.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a &lt;strong&gt;senior leadership role &lt;/strong&gt;with direct impact on revenue, partner satisfaction, and team development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Lead Commercial Strategy &amp;amp; Execution Excellence&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the end-to-end growth of brand portfolios within your Paris Inner cluster&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ensure 5★ account management standards across the team, with clear portfolio sizing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and maintain relationships with senior and C-level stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead contract negotiations, renewals, and upsell strategies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create and execute joint business plans addressing partner growth, profitability, and operational performance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as a trusted advisor, providing insights on Deliveroo capabilities, competitors, and market trends&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsible for a commercial initiative for Paris : engage team, drive performance and proactively adjust structure, focus, or processes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;2. Regional &amp;amp; Portfolio Ownership&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own a zone cluster, defining and executing the strategy to win&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Translate Paris-wide and national priorities into clear, actionable regional strategies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Improve Client Value Proposition (CVP) across the territory in collaboration with other commercial departments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;3. Talent Development &amp;amp; Succession&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead and develop a team of up to 10 AMs / SAMs, either directly or through mid-management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coach and mentor high-potential talent, building a strong internal succession pipeline&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;4. Cross-Functional Leadership&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner closely with Operations, Marketing, Product, Strategy, and Finance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Represent your portfolio and organisation in Paris and France leadership forums&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Influence roadmap and prioritisation through structured partner and market feedback&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in commercial, client partnership, or account management roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing &lt;strong&gt;complex, strategic brand portfolios&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success leading &lt;strong&gt;multi-layered teams&lt;/strong&gt; in fast-paced environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in F&amp;amp;B, Hospitality, Retail, FMCG, or Marketplace businesses preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial and financial acumen (P&amp;amp;L understanding)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent negotiation and stakeholder management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to design and scale&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;organisations and coverage models&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven, structured, and execution-focused&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior, credible, and resilient leader&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High ownership mindset with a bias for action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable navigating ambiguity and driving change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about people development and raising standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Deliveroo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll work on some of the most complex and impactful challenges in local commerce. We move fast, value ownership, and believe that strong teams build great outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role offers &lt;strong&gt;significant scope, visibility, and influence&lt;/strong&gt; in shaping how Deliveroo wins in Paris.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the Team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our global Legal team has built a strong reputation within the company for our highly collaborative and supportive approach to counseling, always with a bias for action. We are a diverse group of lawyers and legal professionals with a shared passion for providing creative, best-in-class service to our business partners. The Competition &amp;amp; Litigation team advises DoorDash, Wolt, and Deliveroo on antitrust, competition, and litigation matters across every market we operate in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Counsel, Competition &amp;amp; Litigation to join our growing Legal team and work globally across the DoorDash, Wolt, and Deliveroo brands. Reporting to the Director, Competition &amp;amp; Litigation, you’ll be a generalist antitrust attorney who can move fast: advising product and business teams in real time, supporting M&amp;amp;A and strategic investments alongside our Corporate Development team, and driving forward regulatory investigations and inquiries, with a particular focus on Europe. This is a hybrid role that will require you to work from our London HQ or Brussels office for a minimum of 3 days a week.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You’re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted antitrust/competition advisor to product, business, and corporate development teams, delivering fast, practical counsel that lets the business move with velocity while properly managing risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on the competition and antitrust dimensions of M&amp;amp;A transactions, strategic investments, and commercial partnerships, partnering closely with Corporate Development and our sales teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage antitrust and competition regulatory investigations and inquiries globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help build out DoorDash’s international competition compliance program, partnering with the Director, Competition &amp;amp; Litigation on training, policies, and processes across DoorDash, Wolt, and Deliveroo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support competition-related litigation matters as needed, including document collection and review, witness preparation, and responses to third-party subpoenas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with policy and government relations teams to track legal and regulatory developments that could affect the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;We’re excited about you because…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a qualified solicitor in England &amp;amp; Wales (or bring similar qualifications in another European jurisdiction) with significant experience providing strategic legal advice to international businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 7+ years of experience at a leading law firm and/or in-house legal department, with a strong grounding in antitrust/competition law as a generalist — spanning M&amp;amp;A counseling, litigation, and regulatory/government investigations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience advising on competition issues in mergers, acquisitions, and strategic investments, including regulatory filings and clearance strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience handling antitrust/competition regulatory inquiries or investigations, ideally including direct engagement with regulators such as the European Commission, UK CMA, DOJ, FTC, or other competition authorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable operating as a generalist across a broad portfolio — you don’t need deep pre-existing expertise in every sub-area, but you can quickly get up to speed and give practical, business-minded advice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re an excellent product counselor: able to translate complex antitrust concepts into clear, fast, actionable guidance for product and business teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable working across multiple jurisdictions and legal systems, and can navigate the added complexity of advising across three global brands (DoorDash, Wolt, and Deliveroo).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong organizational skills and can juggle multiple concurrent workstreams in a fast-moving environment, both independently and as part of a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re an outstanding communicator, both orally and in writing, with sound judgment on when to escalate and when to move forward independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Make a visible impact every day&lt;/strong&gt; Your work directly improves experiences for customers, partners and riders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;Learn fast in an entrepreneurial environment&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with business stakeholders with autonomy, pace and real responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Learn something new everyday&lt;/strong&gt; Stretch yourself, develop new skills and grow as the business evolves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;Deliver together in an inclusive culture&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborative, values-driven teams that support how you work best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine. Our interview process typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about how we hire&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation, and growth drives everything we do. Our Brand &amp;amp; Experience team builds the emotional connection between Deliveroo and our customers, riders, and partners. With a deep understanding of our audience and a passion for creativity, we bring our brand to life across every touchpoint. Whether it’s a push notification, social campaign, or packaging design—we craft compelling experiences that shape perceptions, spark engagement, and make Deliveroo a loved, global brand.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Creative Project Manager to join our London team. This is a hybrid role working 3 days a week from our London HQ. In this role, you’ll help us lead the end-to-end delivery of creative projects across diverse briefs—from fast-turnaround sprints to global, multi-channel campaigns—while driving studio operations and process improvements. This is a 12 month fixed term contract.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be joining the Creative Studio team. Reporting into the PMO Lead, you&#39;ll work alongside Creative, Campaign, Design, and Creative Operations functions to power our in-house marketing and creative output.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Campaign &amp;amp; Project Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the end-to-end delivery of creative briefs—ranging from high-volume growth marketing and CRM sprints to complex, multi-market campaigns including AV and TVC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop accurate project plans, timelines, and milestones while managing budgets and resources to ensure seamless delivery across creative and marketing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Leadership &amp;amp; Traffic Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary contact for projects, building strong relationships across internal teams and partner agencies while keeping everyone aligned on goals and milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage traffic and intake: evaluate briefs, flag out-of-scope requests, manage sprint scheduling, and allocate resources based on team capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operations &amp;amp; Process Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own key PMO operations by refining Asana templates, documentation, and intake workflows to make studio operations more efficient, consistent, and scalable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support studio-wide operational initiatives, including resourcing models, tooling, reporting, and adopting AI-enabled creative production workflows in partnership with our Creative AI Technologist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk Mitigation &amp;amp; Team Mentorship&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify project risks early and implement effective solution strategies to keep work moving smoothly without compromising quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivate and guide creative project teams, sharing best practices across the PMO and supporting less experienced project managers and freelancers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience managing end-to-end creative projects and integrated campaigns within an in-house studio or creative marketing agency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability in resource management, capacity planning, and traffic management for high-volume, fast-turnaround performance and growth marketing assets (paid social, CRM, in-app).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of creative operations, including intake flows, studio tooling (e.g., Asana), project documentation, and process optimization across local and global markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional stakeholder management and communication skills, with the confidence to challenge, motivate, and align cross-functional teams and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to manage project budgets, mitigate risks proactively, and deliver high-quality work to tight deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience integrating AI tools and adoption strategies into creative production and studio workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing and onboarding external agencies or freelance resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
