&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Partnering:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with cross-functional stakeholders in Operations and regional teams to streamline accounting workflows and improve data quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audit &amp;amp; Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Coordinate internal and external audit requests while maintaining comprehensive documentation for key accounting processes and SOPs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
