&lt;p&gt;Our ideal candidate will bring strong expertise in some of these areas and curiosity to grow in others:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Qualification:&lt;/strong&gt; ACA, ACCA, CIMA or equivalent accountancy qualification with at least 4 years of post-qualified experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Depth:&lt;/strong&gt; Significant post-qualification experience within a complex, fast-paced financial environment, ideally with a focus on group reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
