&lt;p&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Decision Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with stakeholders across the business to develop new investment decision-making frameworks and drive strategy in a dynamic environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth vs. Profitability:&lt;/strong&gt; Own complex models and analyses to help the business strike the optimal balance between aggressive growth and long-term profitability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Custom Financial Modelling:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead high-impact modelling exercises to support key initiatives, sizing new opportunities and building business cases for innovative products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPI Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Track and analyse key financial and business KPIs to uncover trends, assessing current and future risks while identifying new market opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead special projects to automate and scale our forecasting and reporting tools, ensuring our methodologies evolve alongside the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with operators and departmental leaders to develop new policies and ensure day-to-day execution aligns with our financial targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
