&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to procurement transformation initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;, championing new tooling, AI-driven sourcing workflows, and continuous process improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
