&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;You’ll be joining the Integrated Marketing team. We own the Deliveroo brand globally and lead our biggest campaign moments. Working in a cross-functional squad alongside strategic teams, functional leads, and local markets, we turn big ideas into high-impact campaigns across our markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;
