&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation, and growth drives everything we do. Our Commercial team sits at the centre of Deliveroo’s marketplace—shaping how we serve restaurants, grocers, and new verticals worldwide. From negotiating key partnerships to unlocking new revenue streams and crafting data-led growth strategies, we take on big challenges that move the business forward. If you thrive in fast-paced, commercial environments and want to influence the future of a global brand—this is the team for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Onboarding Associate to join our UAE team. You’ll guide new restaurant, ODC and retail partners in the UAE and Kuwait from sign-up to launch. You’ll coordinate each onboarding step, keep partners informed and help them go live smoothly and on time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Get to know our &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Commercial team &lt;/span&gt;— what drives us, how we work, and what you can expect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;You’ll join the Middle East Partner Onboarding team and support new restaurant, ODC and retail partners from signed agreement to successful launch. Most support is provided through non-live channels, with calls or other contact used when preferred by the partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp; Own the onboarding journey for new restaurant, ODC and retail partners, from signed agreement through to launch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp; Complete partner admin setup and coordinate menu or catalogue creation, following up on missing information to keep each launch on track.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp; Coordinate tablet delivery, installation and partner training with the relevant internal teams and partner contacts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp; Support partners with admin, menu and catalogue questions, using the communication channel that best suits their needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp; Investigate complex onboarding issues, coordinate the right resolution and keep partners and internal stakeholders updated until the issue is closed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp; Work closely with Sales and Menu teams to resolve questions relating to newly signed partners, missing content and setup requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp; Maintain accurate onboarding trackers, complete a clear handover of live partners to the assigned NPX or Account Manager, and share best practices across the UAE and Kuwait.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Our ideal candidate will bring strong expertise in some of these areas and curiosity to grow in others:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp; Ability to manage partner onboarding or operational workflows independently and take ownership through to completion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp; Strong organisation and prioritisation skills, with the ability to manage multiple partners at different onboarding stages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp; A service-focused and solution-oriented approach to partner questions, operational blockers and escalations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp; Strong attention to detail when reviewing partner information and updating systems, menus, catalogues and trackers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp; Clear written and verbal communication, with the judgement to adapt the channel and level of detail to each partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp; Confidence working with Sales, Menu, Operations and account management teams across different markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;•&amp;nbsp; Ability to learn and use CRM, knowledge-base and telephony tools; previous experience with these systems is helpful but not essential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make a visible impact every day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Your work directly improves experiences for customers, partners and riders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn fast in an entrepreneurial environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Work close to the market with autonomy, pace and real responsibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build a career, not just a role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Stretch yourself, develop new skills and grow as the business evolves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver together in an inclusive culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Collaborative, values-driven teams that support how you work best.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;how we hire &lt;/span&gt;here.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Senior Payroll Analyst&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Global Payroll team and play a key role in the delivery and continuous improvement of payroll across our international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior operational role with responsibility for overseeing payroll activity across multiple countries. You will bring strong payroll expertise, sound judgement and a proactive approach to ensure employees are paid accurately, on time and in compliance with local legislation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with the Payroll Team, internal HR and People teams, Finance, Tax and external payroll providers, you will take ownership of complex payroll activities, provide subject-matter expertise and act as a key escalation point for payroll issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role will also provide opportunities to support &lt;strong&gt;international payroll projects, process improvements, system implementations and automation&lt;/strong&gt;, helping Deliveroo build a scalable and efficient global payroll operation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of the &lt;strong&gt;end-to-end payroll delivery&lt;/strong&gt; for assigned international entities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with local HR, People Operations, Finance and Tax teams to ensure payroll inputs are complete, accurate and delivered within agreed timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review, validate and approve payroll inputs and outputs, identifying discrepancies, trends and potential risks before payroll is finalised.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply a strong understanding of &lt;strong&gt;legislation across multiple jurisdictions, statutory requirements and payroll practices&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring processes remain compliant and appropriately controlled.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with external payroll providers, holding them accountable for &lt;strong&gt;accuracy, timeliness, compliance and service delivery&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a senior escalation point for complex employee and stakeholder payroll queries, providing clear guidance and appropriate resolutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform and oversee payroll reconciliations, payment validation and statutory submissions, ensuring appropriate controls are completed and documented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse payroll data and reporting to identify anomalies, control weaknesses, recurring issues and opportunities for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain strong payroll governance and documentation, ensuring processes, controls and procedures are consistently followed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify opportunities to &lt;strong&gt;simplify, standardise and automate payroll processes&lt;/strong&gt;, reducing manual intervention and operational risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and lead payroll-related projects, including &lt;strong&gt;system implementations, payroll migrations, integrations, process changes and new entity onboarding&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Technology and payroll vendors to troubleshoot system and integration issues and support effective resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development of payroll policies, procedures, controls and best practices across international markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share knowledge and provide guidance to Payroll Analysts and other team members, helping to build capability and consistency across the wider team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up to date with changes to payroll legislation and communicate relevant impacts to internal stakeholders and payroll providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Payroll Lead with wider global payroll initiatives and deputise where required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience working in a &lt;strong&gt;payroll analyst or senior payroll position&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally within a complex, international organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on experience of &lt;strong&gt;international payroll&lt;/strong&gt;, with experience of &lt;strong&gt;Italy and/or France payroll highly desirable&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good working knowledge of Italian and/or French payroll legislation, statutory requirements and payroll processes is preferable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing payroll across multiple countries and working with &lt;strong&gt;third-party payroll providers&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of payroll controls, reconciliations, payments, statutory reporting and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, with the ability to interrogate payroll data, identify discrepancies and understand the root cause of issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent attention to detail and a strong focus on payroll accuracy and risk management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of identifying and implementing &lt;strong&gt;process improvements, automation and operational efficiencies&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting or leading payroll projects, system implementations or payroll migrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Excel skills and confidence working with payroll data and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;Workday/Cloudpay&lt;/strong&gt; or other HR/payroll technology is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management skills, with the confidence to challenge, influence and provide a clear point of view.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to explain complex payroll matters clearly to both payroll and non-payroll stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, solutions-focused approach and the confidence to question &lt;strong&gt;the why and the how&lt;/strong&gt; behind existing processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Deliveroo?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo’s mission is to build the definitive food company by making food more convenient and accessible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a technology-driven business in one of the world’s fastest-growing industries, Deliveroo offers the opportunity to make a real impact while working in a fast-paced and innovative environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo also offers a wide range of competitive benefits across health, family, finance, community, convenience, growth, time away and relocation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workplace and diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is committed to building a workplace that reflects the diversity of the world around us and where everyone can belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There is no judgement when it comes to the things that make people who they are — whether that is gender, race, sexuality, religion or even a secret aversion to coriander.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are passionate about food and excited to help shape one of the fastest-growing companies in an exciting space, Deliveroo would love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation and growth drive everything we do. Our Analytics organisation sits at the heart of Deliveroo powering decision-making across product, commercial and operations through experimentation and causal inference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Data Scientist&lt;/strong&gt; to join our &lt;strong&gt;London&lt;/strong&gt; team (working hybrid, 3 days in the office). In this role, you’ll enable high-quality human-led decision-making to maximise impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring multiple Senior Data Scientists across different areas of the business. Rather than hiring for one fixed team, we use the interview process to understand your strengths, interests and development areas, and then align you to the right scope, remit and team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Our Analytics Organisation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have an outstanding analytics organisation, with a mission to enable the highest quality human and machine decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our community is highly active, with guest lectures, study groups, mentorship programmes and a robust technical review process. Data Scientists can progress equally as technical leads or people managers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our data scientists come from all kinds of backgrounds but have excellence in common. Many are formally trained in data science, many are not.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will help answer questions like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Which markets/cities should we enter next?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How can we incentivise good rider behaviour?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What is the impact of exclusive deals we have with restaurants?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How do we optimise our compensation policy to keep our customers happy and ordering with Deliveroo?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What are the trade-offs we face when choosing between growth and profitability? How should we decide between them?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How much should our pricing vary by distance and by market?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What is the optimum selection and variety of restaurants in a particular area?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How do we adapt our consumer app to better suit grocery shoppers?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Significant experience in Data Science (or similar) roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience leading both simple and more complex experiment designs, with the ability to proactively unpick insights to steer strategic decision making&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Great communication skills - in person, in writing, in code; to technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Through solid analysis, provide clear and actionable recommendations that influence the team&#39;s roadmap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Effective problem-solving, demonstrating an ability to successfully address complex and ambiguous challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to think creatively and insightfully about business problems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proficiency with analytical tools like R/Python and familiarity with SQL. Proficiency with Cursor/AI tools to deliver impactful, high-quality work efficiently is also valued&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A pragmatic, flexible approach, where you most care about achieving impact&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent people skills — you&#39;ll be meeting with a range of both technical and non-technical stakeholders to translate business needs into data science problems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Solve meaningful problems at real scale&lt;/strong&gt; Work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;See your impact, fast&lt;/strong&gt; Ship, test and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Grow through challenge and ownership&lt;/strong&gt; Take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;A culture built for builders&lt;/strong&gt; High standards, collaboration, flexible working and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;​​💰 &lt;strong&gt;Share in the success you help create&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive salary and equity options, so you’re rewarded for the impact you make.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/how-we-hire/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; &lt;u&gt;how we hire here&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
