&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a dynamic and results-driven Manager, Subscriptions Partnerships to join our Subscription EMEA Partnerships &amp;amp; Commercial team. Deliveroo Plus and Wolt+ are our subscription programmes, offering customers exclusive benefits like free delivery and special offers. In this role, you will lead strategic partnerships to drive awareness, engagement, and subscriber growth, while creating value for our members and partners alike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible globally for i) owning strategy and execution for our high-stakes strategic Deliveroo Plus / Wolt Plus distribution partnerships or benefits partnerships, ii) owning the relationships between our partners alongside our Global Business Development team, ensuring successful win-win relationships. You’ll work with the wider Subscriptions EMEA team and other cross-functional teams in the domains of Business Development, Marketing, Product, Engineering, Analytics and Finance, while taking full ownership of driving your initiatives to fruition and most importantly tangible results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is your opportunity to join one of the most successful growth companies in Europe and improve the daily lives of millions of people!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;: craft the short and long-term strategy for Deliveroo Plus/Wolt+ distribution and benefits partnerships that will enable faster growth and higher value proposition of our membership program globally, with high scalability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Partnerships:&lt;/strong&gt; progress new partner negotiations in collaboration with our Global Business Development team, and launching them through successful go-to-market (GTM) processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance: &lt;/strong&gt;Track and own key performance indicators and targets in the domain and, where necessary, drive correction actions. This might be by pulling short-term levers with our marketing team or forming up long-term product-driven features to solve for underlying drivers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead the end-to-end implementation of new initiatives and launches, coordinating efforts across internal teams and external partners to ensure seamless execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Joint Business Planning and Relationship Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate with partner counterparts to build strong relationships, create joint business plans, address key challenges, define mutual goals, and deliver innovative solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of proven and relevant experience preferably in (i) strategic business development, (ii) subscriptions and loyalty programs or iii) strategy &amp;amp; operations in a top tier tech/platform company / management consulting. Preferably demonstrated success in building and managing high-impact partnerships or collaborations with external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem-solving skills:&lt;/strong&gt; our team is in the business of solving hard problems and developing new solutions - not just in the abstract but also on the lowest level of detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People &amp;amp; project management skills:&lt;/strong&gt; you’ll need to be able to inspire and persuade internal and external stakeholders from a broad spectrum of backgrounds in a cross-team setting and get them to work towards one goal in a coordinated, collaborative and efficient manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive, ownership and independence:&lt;/strong&gt; you’ll be given responsibility and freedom in terms of how to get stuff done. In exchange, you’ll need to be comfortable and effective at being in the driver’s seat in your initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical skills and AI fluency: &lt;/strong&gt;you’ll work with data every single day so spreadsheet, AI and data mastery is a must-have. As we have data on almost anything available, you’ll need to be comfortable to drive data driven decision making by distilling the key insights out of it, and using AI effectively.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business acumen and eye for great customer experience&lt;/strong&gt;: you’ll need to have good intuition about what works best for our customers to ensure that we focus on solving the right problems in the right way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Value Proposition &amp;amp; New Benefits team owns what our core value proposition for subscription should be, and the new benefits that bring it to life. We sit within the wider Subscription EMEA org, whose vision is to create the world&#39;s leading membership programme in local commerce, delivering unprecedented value and a world-class experience to members.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Strategy &amp;amp; Operations Manager to own strategy and execution for new benefits within Subscription. This is a hybrid strategy/build/run role: you&#39;ll define what to launch, then work cross-functionally to get it shipped and measure whether it&#39;s working. You&#39;ll be expected to move fluidly between strategic thinking and hands-on execution — this is not a role where strategy stops at a slide deck.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Typical problems you&#39;ll own:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;What new benefits should we launch for Subscription — which ideas are worth pursuing, and what&#39;s the business case for each?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How do we prioritise and sequence a pipeline of benefit ideas against limited engineering, design, and operational capacity?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How do we define success for a new benefit before launch — what does a good outcome look like, and what would tell us to kill it?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Once live, how is a benefit actually performing — impact on acquisition, retention, frequency, and member satisfaction — against its cost to serve, and what does that tell us to do next?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How do we take a benefit from a small pilot to a scaled, steady-state feature, and what needs to be true operationally for that to work?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the strategy and roadmap&lt;/strong&gt; for new benefits within Subscription — build the analysis, the business case, and the plan, and drive it through to execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional delivery&lt;/strong&gt; — partner with Product, Engineering, Design, Data Science, Marketing, and Finance to take benefit ideas from concept to launch, without formal authority over any of them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and prioritise the benefit pipeline&lt;/strong&gt; — evaluate a stream of ideas (experiential, use-case specific, or otherwise), size their potential impact and cost, and decide what&#39;s worth building next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Track ongoing performance&lt;/strong&gt; — maintain visibility into each live benefit&#39;s impact on acquisition, retention, frequency, and satisfaction against its cost to serve, flagging when something needs attention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale what works&lt;/strong&gt; — take benefits from small pilots to steady-state features, defining the operating model, reporting cadence, and processes needed to run them sustainably.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring outside-in perspective&lt;/strong&gt; — track what Uber One, DashPass, Wolt+, Just Eat and Amazon Prime are doing with membership benefits, and translate what&#39;s relevant into Deliveroo&#39;s context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicate to senior stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt; — write clear strategy documents and present recommendations, trade-offs, and results to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in strategy &amp;amp; operations, strategy consulting, or business operations — ideally with exposure to marketplaces, subscription/membership businesses, or consumer tech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial acumen&lt;/strong&gt;: strong understanding of marketplace dynamics and subscriber value; comfortable building a business case and owning a set of P&amp;amp;L-adjacent metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical rigor&lt;/strong&gt;: comfortable interpreting data and experiment results to make a clear business call — you&#39;ll partner with Data Science on the &quot;how&quot; and &quot;so what.&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bias for action and ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: able to bring structure and clarity to ambiguous problems (&quot;what should we build, and how will we know it worked?&quot;), and to drive execution personally rather than just recommend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional influence&lt;/strong&gt;: track record of aligning senior stakeholders and diverse functions (Product, Eng, Finance, Marketing) around a shared plan in a fast-moving, matrixed environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication — able to distill complex trade-offs into a clear recommendation for leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-market experience across EMEA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in a subscription, loyalty, or membership business (delivery, e-commerce, fintech, or otherwise).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Benefits (Deliveroo standard — adjust per market)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free Subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 5% matched pension contributions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity / share awards eligibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days annual leave plus bank holidays, increasing with tenure, plus 1 day paid volunteering leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Funded private healthcare (core plan), with option to add family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellbeing perks: on-site gym / discounted gym membership, GymPass access&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced parental leave from day one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning &amp;amp; development budget and access to RooLearn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to Work / Season Ticket Loan schemes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
